# Accessibility

<version>1.0.0</version>

## Context
- All UI and interactive elements

## Requirements
- All buttons and inputs must be keyboard accessible
- Use appropriate ARIA labels where needed
- Ensure color contrast and font size meet accessibility standards

## Examples
<example>
<button aria-label="Export as Image">Export</button>
</example>
<example type="invalid">
<div onClick={exportAsImage}>Export</div>
</example>
